@finished
title: The Coalition is finalized.
tags: coalition_1922
subtitle: The government has a [+ coalition_mandate +]/100% seat mandate.
unavailable-subtitle: 50% Mandate required. The government currently has a [+ coalition_mandate +]/100% mandate, we may require more parties in or tolerating the government.
choose-if: coalition_mandate >= 50

Finally, the PPS can govern, Polish Socialism has finally been brought again in the Sejm.

